+
+Refined normalized model:
+- SubagentSubtree { SameThread, ExternalSession(SessionId) }
+- SubagentRoot { tool_call_id, subagent_type, subtree }
+- SubagentMembership { parent, subagent_type }  (same-thread members only)
+- SubagentIndex { roots: IndexMap<ToolCallId, SubagentRoot>, membership: HashMap<...> }
+  with LAZY root_of()/depth_of() walking parent pointers (robust to out-of-order arrival).
+- trait SubagentGrouping { fn classify(&self, id, meta) -> Classification }
